From: MANET <manet@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] mt76: mt7915: identify the timing build for firmware selection

Expose a capability tag for the installed-module firmware gate. This is not
a claim that patched firmware has survived early boot on hardware.

---
diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt76/mt7915/pci.c b/drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt76/mt7915/pci.c
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt76/mt7915/pci.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt76/mt7915/pci.c
@@ -240,3 +240,5 @@
 MODULE_FIRMWARE(MT7916_FIRMWARE_WA);
 MODULE_FIRMWARE(MT7916_FIRMWARE_WM);
 MODULE_FIRMWARE(MT7916_ROM_PATCH);
+
+MODULE_INFO(manet_timing, "1");
